    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622800/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1753714072\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622800/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1753714072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622800/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1753714072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ZCurse: Zombie base defense game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ZCurse</strong> is a <strong>fast-paced stylized zombie survival game</strong> where you defend your base from endless waves of undead enemies. Fight off the horde, <strong>build and repair your defenses</strong>, unlock powerful weapons, and upgrade your skills in this <strong>roguelite action shooter</strong> experience!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast-paced zombie combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622800/extras/e7dd03b02fd1f8039ea82b31456ebd8c.poster.avif?t=1753714072\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622800/extras/e7dd03b02fd1f8039ea82b31456ebd8c.webm?t=1753714072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622800/extras/e7dd03b02fd1f8039ea82b31456ebd8c.mp4?t=1753714072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think fast. Act faster. Reinforce weak points, reposition on the fly, and make critical calls as waves of zombies swarm your defenses. One wrong move can cost everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelite survival shooters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622800/extras/df60cd9c16e86f50bf927b151883898c.poster.avif?t=1753714072\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622800/extras/df60cd9c16e86f50bf927b151883898c.webm?t=1753714072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622800/extras/df60cd9c16e86f50bf927b151883898c.mp4?t=1753714072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just fighting to kill\u2014you\u2019re fighting to <i>last</i>. Every moment you survive brings a glimmer of hope. But hope fades quickly when the dead never stop coming. Will your walls hold? Or will the curse consume you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapon switching and upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622800/extras/fc36fd7d2a49e95c292fd74d082805a9.poster.avif?t=1753714072\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622800/extras/fc36fd7d2a49e95c292fd74d082805a9.webm?t=1753714072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622800/extras/fc36fd7d2a49e95c292fd74d082805a9.mp4?t=1753714072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In ZCurse, failure is part of the plan. Each attempt lets you collect resources, unlock permanent upgrades, and enhance your shelter\u2019s defenses. The next survivor will be stronger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Zombie base defense</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622800/extras/1fac7810c89426a4075f1537eab26457.poster.avif?t=1753714072\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622800/extras/1fac7810c89426a4075f1537eab26457.webm?t=1753714072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622800/extras/1fac7810c89426a4075f1537eab26457.mp4?t=1753714072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every second matters. Construct walls, lay traps, and create chokepoints to control the battlefield. Your firepower alone won\u2019t be enough\u2014only those who build smart will endure the endless horde.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Can You Outlast the Curse?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nightmare doesn\u2019t end\u2026 but you just might outlive it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add ZCurse to your wishlist now</strong> and prepare for a relentless battle where only the smartest\u2014and toughest\u2014survive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622800/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.poster.avif?t=1753714072\" width=480 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622800/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.webm?t=1753714072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622800/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.mp4?t=1753714072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
